4. LIGHTING: crisp natural or task lighting with realistic material colors and a distinct accent appropriate to the scene. Avoid repeated beige/brown, golden hour, green shirts, coffee mugs and tablets. Do not mimic institutional colors/layouts or uniforms. Vary activity, setting and framing, not just the subject's gender.
5. BOTTOM 40% = CLEAN DARK GRADIENT: a heavy, smooth cinematic black gradient fade in the lower 40% that transitions seamlessly into solid black at the very bottom edge, creating a completely clean, EMPTY space free of any text, logos, faces or graphic elements — reserved for white typography overlay.
